<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Sonny Liston returns for his four-month review. The commission physician cleared him to box after reviewing his readings, and he is back to full sparring. His home readings average 120/76 mmHg. He takes amlodipine 10 mg and valsartan 160 mg and naltrexone 50 mg each morning. He drinks about eight drinks a week, never more than three in a day, and none in the two weeks before a bout. He is sleeping well and says he feels sharper in training. He has thought about the adult reading class he was told about and wants to wait until after his next fight. No thoughts of suicide. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Home readings</td><td>Average 120/76 mmHg</td></tr><tr><td>AUDIT</td><td>7, from 16 at intake</td></tr><tr><td>GGT</td><td>41 U/L, normal</td></tr><tr><td>PHQ-9</td><td>2; item 9 scored 0</td></tr><tr><td>Vaccine today</td><td>Influenza</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

